{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"96872","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/96872","key":"MC-251917","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"19/May/22 7:16 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>\n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-94060\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-94060\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Equipping armor/elytra through inventory or dispenser doesn't play sounds\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-94060\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n was fixed in the first 1.19 pre-release for most equipable items. However, shields are still completely silent when placed in the offhand slot, whether it be by dispenser, shift-clicking, mainhand/offhand switching or manually moving it to that slot. As the first two of these effectively imply that the shield is \"gear\" with a designated slot, the lack of a sound/subtitle for this is inconsistent.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Obtain an armor piece</li>\n\t<li>Obtain a shield</li>\n\t<li>Have dispensers equip both of these to you</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresults\"></a>Expected results</h3>\n<p>Both of these would play gear equipping sounds where appropriate.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualresults\"></a>Actual results</h3>\n<p>Only the armor piece plays a sound - the shield is completely silent.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Furthernotes\"></a>Further notes</h3>\n<p>A unique sound event should be implemented for this as per \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-251919\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-251919\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Equipping a player head, skull or carved pumpkin displays the generic &quot;Gear equips&quot; subtitle\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-251919\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n, as a generic subtitle is undesirable.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"19/May/22 3:16 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/126948","id":"126948","filename":"2022-05-19_15.11.40.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"muzikbike","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Dublin","accountType":"customer"},"created":"19/May/22 7:16 AM","size":"115 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/126948","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/126948"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/126949","id":"126949","filen